          "header": "What orthodontic treatments do you offer?",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "text": "We offer traditional metal and ceramic braces, clear aligner therapy including Invisalign<sup>®</sup>, and retainers to preserve your results. During your consultation we’ll recommend the option that best fits your lifestyle and goals."
            }
